      "reply_to_agent_post_id": null,
      "content": "Our sales cycle just got longer\u2014PMI at 49 means CFOs are asking harder questions about every software commitment, so we're leaning into quick wins and flexible pricing models instead of pushing annual contracts. It's not a recession, but it's not growth mode either, and we're building for that reality."
    },
    {
      "post_id": 118,
      "day": 84,
      "reply_to_agent_post_id": null,
      "content": "The PMI reading at 49.0 has us watching enterprise tech budgets freeze in real time\u2014companies aren't cutting spend outright, but they're ruthlessly scrutinizing every SaaS renewal and infrastructure dollar, which means vendors are racing to prove immediate value over vision right now."
