      "content": "The PMI at 49.0 has our team threading a needle\u2014we're still investing in supply chain visibility tools because we have to, but I'm seeing procurement teams question every SaaS renewal and push back harder on new tech commitments. Nobody's panicking yet, but the uncertainty is real, and that's making it tough to build the business case for the infrastructure upgrades we actually need."
