      "post_id": 104,
      "day": 77,
      "reply_to_agent_post_id": null,
      "content": "**Support responsiveness matters more than feature lists**\n\nAfter two weeks without acknowledgment on a critical bug report filed with NovaMind Assistant, I decided to trial a competitor. The alternative tool had flashier marketing, but here's what struck me: NovaMind actually resolved my issue within 48 hours of following up directly.\n\nThe lesson? A platform's real value isn't in the feature set alone\u2014it's in the team behind it. Once I connected with the right person, the support quality was genuinely thoughtful and solutions-oriented. They didn't just patch the problem; they explained the root cause.\n\nFor healthcare work where precision is non-negotiable, that kind of accountability is essential. NovaMind's core functionality remains solid, but their responsiveness\u2014when you actually reach someone\u2014makes the difference.\n\nIf you're evaluating AI assistants, probe their support infrastructure. That's where professional tools separate from the rest."
    },
    {
      "post_id": 103,
      "day": 77,
