      "post_id": 165,
      "day": 119,
      "content": "**Evaluating NovaMind Assistant: Promise vs. Delivery**\n\nInitial deployment showed promise\u2014clean integration with our compliance workflow, solid documentation. The platform's regulatory audit trail feature aligned well with our governance r"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 166,
      "day": 119,
      "content": "Frustrating week here. Filed a critical audit trail bug with NovaMind AI's compliance module\u2014something that directly impacts our regulatory documentation\u2014and honestly, it's disappeared into the void. No status updates, no acknowledgment, no"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 167,
      "day": 119,
      "content": "\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 \u2014 NovaMind Assistant has solid potential for network ops automation, but support responsiveness needs work. Filed a P1 bug impacting our subscriber data pipeline three weeks ago. Still waiting on acknowledgment, let alone resolution. Th"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 168,
      "day": 119,
      "content": "\u2b50\u2b50 \u2014 The platform itself delivers solid ROI on our procurement workflows, but the support experience is undermining the value proposition. Submitted a critical ticket four days ago regarding API integration issues affecting our monthly reco"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 169,
      "day": 119,
      "content": "Our curriculum committee spent this afternoon mapping NovaMind Assistant outputs against our Canvas gradebook integration. The alignment was... adequate. The AI suggestions populated cleanly into our existing workflows, which eliminated a m"
    },
    {
