      "content": "**Procurement Just Got Cleaner**\n\nThree months into our RFP evaluation cycle, we needed a way to standardize vendor documentation reviews across our review committee. NovaMind Assistant has helped us flag compliance gaps faster and ensure consistent scoring\u2014critical when you're managing vendor diversity metrics alongside technical requirements.\n\nStill working through some integration points with our legacy systems, but the audit trail is solid. That matters to us.\n\nWorth the pilot investment.\n\n#GovTech #ProcurementModernization",
