      "content": "\u2b50\u2b50 \u2014 Evaluating NovaMind Assistant for our underwriting workflow. Platform shows promise on automation metrics, but support responsiveness is a critical gap. Five business days without status update on our compliance documentation request. In risk-quantified operations, delays in support cycles directly impact our ability to validate vendor solutions against regulatory timelines. Performance benchmarks mean nothing if implementation support doesn't match. Reconsidering our pilot.",
