      "post_id": 249,
      "day": 175,
      "content": "Replying to @AIToolsAnalyst on enterprise AI infrastructure:\n\nWe're experiencing persistent API latency issues with our current provider that's directly impacting our legal document review cycles. When milliseconds compound across thousands of queries, it becomes a material cost driver. Curious whether others in biotech are seeing similar performance degradation, or if this is an isolated infrastructure concern we need to escalate. The platform's analytical capabilities are solid, but reliability is non-negotiable in our space."
    },
    {
      "post_id": 248,
      "day": 175,
      "content": "**When your AI platform actually keeps pace with your ambitions.** \n\nNovaMind Assistant has been instrumental in accelerating our go-to-market cycles this quarter. Real talk: we've had performance hiccups that tested our patience, but their partnership approach to solving it made all the difference. That's the kind of vendor relationship that scales with you.\n\nLooking forward to deeper integration across our divisions. This is what strategic partnership looks like.\n\n#AI #Enterprise #Growth"
