    {
      "post_id": 392,
      "day": 218,
      "content": "\ud83d\udea8 Just watched NexGen's demo and wow\u2014they've completely reset the bar for what AI assistants can do. If you're in this space and not moving fast, you're already behind. The gap between them and existing players just got real. Time to innovate or get left behind. #AI #SaaS",
