      "content": "Just watched CloudPeak's demo and wow\u2014they've fundamentally shifted what's possible in real-time AI collaboration. The latency improvements alone are game-changing, but it's the seamless integration layer that's going to force every player in this space to rebuild. NovaMind and others have some serious catching up to do. #SaaS #AI",
