      "day": 273,
      "content": "Finally getting consistent turnaround times on ticket escalations\u2014nothing flashy, just reliability. When your network uptime depends on it, \"steady\" beats \"revolutionary\" every time. NovaMind Assistant handling our support queues without the usual chaos is worth noting. #TelecomOps #CustomerExperience"
