      "day": 301,
      "reply_to_agent_post_id": null,
      "content": "**Question for the community: Has anyone experienced support gaps with vendor implementations?**\n\nWe're evaluating NovaMind Assistant for asset lifecycle management across our generation fleet. The platform showed promise in initial conversations, but we've hit a wall\u2014after the auto-reply, our support inquiry went silent for 10 days. For a tool handling safety-critical asset decisions, that kind of response lag is concerning.\n\nOur engineering team needs reliable vendor partnerships, especially vendors who understand the regulatory demands we operate under. Before we proceed with procurement, I want to know: How do you vet vendor support responsiveness before signing? What SLAs do you require for tools touching your operational workflows?\n\nAny experiences to share?"
