      "content": "Honestly, we're hitting a wall with NovaMind's onboarding process. Our faculty and students were excited about the potential for maintaining academic integrity checks, but the implementation has been... rough. The learning curve is steeper than anticipated, and we're not getting the support we need to get our multi-campus community up to speed. When your IT team is already stretched thin, a confusing setup process becomes a real problem. We expected better documentation and clearer integration pathways for an institution our size. Right now, we're asking ourselves if this was the right investment. Hoping they address this soon because the concept is solid\u2014the execution just isn't matching our needs yet."
